# .clinerules - Mamikos Backend Laravel

## Architecture & Folder Structure
- Use standard Laravel MVC / Service Layer pattern under `app`:
  - `Http/Controllers`: REST controllers and request handling.
  - `Http/Requests`: Form Request validation classes.
  - `Http/Resources`: API Resources for response transformation.
  - `Services`: Business logic implementations.
  - `Models`: Eloquent ORM models.
  - `Repositories`: Data access layer / repository pattern.
  - `Exceptions`: Custom exception handlers.

## Coding Standards & Best Practices
- **SOLID Principles & Clean Code**: Single responsibility, dependency injection via constructor, Form Requests for input validation.
- **Exception Handling**: Uniform error responses using Laravel exception handler.

## Git Commit Policy (Strict)
- Commit **every single change** (feature, refactor, bug fix, test, chore) immediately with clear, descriptive commit messages conforming to Conventional Commits format (`feat: ...`, `fix: ...`, `refactor: ...`, `test: ...`, `chore: ...`).
- Never bundle unrelated changes into a single big commit.
